When the job calls for serious hauling, PJ Trailers’ dump trailers are built to deliver. Designed
for everything from gravel and soil to scrap and construction debris, they offer the strength and
reliability needed on demanding job sites. A rugged bed, high load capacity, and responsive
hydraulic system make unloading simple, while a stable build supports better control during
transport. With multiple lengths, tandem axle options, and upgrades like the Rollster™ roll-off, you
can choose a setup that fits your workload. Built with durable, wear-resistant materials, these
trailers are made to perform and hold up over time.

