[ Shop All Tilt Trailers ][59]

No ramps needed— it starts with PJ Trailers' premium tilt trailers. Hydraulic cylinders provide
smooth, controlled tilting, while the optimized deck design reduces load angles for safer operation.
Available in multiple configurations, including single-axle and gooseneck models, these trailers
handle loads from 5,200 to 28,000 lbs. Built for versatility, they transport everything from heavy
equipment and machinery to vehicles and construction materials. Durable materials ensure stability
on rough terrain, cutting costs by eliminating extra loading equipment. A tilt trailer is a smart
investment that boosts efficiency, reduces hassle, and delivers lasting value.

